  "steps": [
    "Cook the bacon in a large skillet over medium heat until crisp, then remove it and leave the drippings.",
    "Cook the onion, bell pepper and celery in the drippings for 5 minutes, until soft.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 30 seconds.",
    "Stir in the corn and tomatoes and cook for 8 to 10 minutes.",
    "Add the cream, cayenne, salt and pepper and simmer for 5 minutes, until thickened.",
    "Top with the bacon and green onions and serve warm."
